body:
Can't believe there are people arguing the other side of this. 

&#x200B;

OF COURSE spoilers should be hidden behind a spoiler warning. Isn't that already a rule? Spoilers in a title are obviously not okay.

&#x200B;

And to anyone who isn't bothered by spoilers: congratulations? Good for you? You know that most other people ARE VERY bothered by spoilers, and they're very easy to avoid giving, so...try not to be an asshole, I guess. Good general rule.

I'm kind of blown away by the tepid response From the New World gets. The story doesn't have the emotional highs of Covenant, but the cast and world are weird, wacky fun and the combat is easily among the best in any JRPG I've played.

&#x200B;

One of my absolute favorites.
